de Lorazepam.

124
00:12:16,970 --> 00:12:17,970
Tómalo con calma.

125
00:12:27,826 --> 00:12:28,826
Ella aún no responde.

126
00:12:28,851 --> 00:12:30,594
Dale 20 miligramos más.

127
00:12:43,046 --> 00:12:44,427
Vamos Sarah, respira.

128
00:12:47,789 --> 00:12:48,789
<i>¿Cuánto tiempo?</i>

129
00:12:49,027 --> 00:12:50,468
<i>Treinta minutos sin
un latido del corazón.</i>

130
00:12:50,492 --> 00:12:52,295
Detente, detente.
Detén la RCP.

131
00:12:53,416 --> 00:12:55,281
Ella se ha ido. Se ha ido.

132
00:12:56,329 --> 00:12:57,702
Se ha ido.

133
00:13:20,423 --> 00:13:21,423
<i>Señor Shepherd,</i>

134
00:13:23,466 --> 00:13:24,466
<i>¿está ahí?</i>

135
00:13:25,841 --> 00:13:26,841
